# Canonical domain: send legacy abmize.com hostnames to sitgrf.com (301, forced).
# Requires abmize.com / www.abmize.com to remain assigned to this Netlify site as aliases.
# See: https://docs.netlify.com/manage/routing/redirects/redirect-options/#domain-level-redirects
http://abmize.com/*        https://sitgrf.com/:splat  301!
https://abmize.com/*       https://sitgrf.com/:splat  301!
http://www.abmize.com/*    https://sitgrf.com/:splat  301!
https://www.abmize.com/*   https://sitgrf.com/:splat  301!
